Proof: Define A_i = \{n_i \text{ not covered by retrieval}\}. By (H-cov-3), P(A_i) \leq \min_{k \in C(n_i)} \varepsilon_{i,k}. Define B_a = \{\text{evidence fails to span along }a\}. By (H-cov-4), P(B_a) \leq \delta_a. Coverage fails if \bigcup_i A_i \cup \bigcup_a B_a. Union bound:

