Statement: Under (H-cov), (H4a), (H4b), (H4c):

P(\text{sound certification}) \geq 1 - \varepsilon_C - \varepsilon_E - \varepsilon_L - \varepsilon_{\mathrm{crypto}}

Proof: Coverage holds with prob \geq 1-\varepsilon_C. Conditioned on coverage, extraction succeeds with prob \geq 1-\varepsilon_E. Conditioned on extraction, legal inference succeeds with prob \geq 1-\varepsilon_L. Cryptographic commitment sound except with prob \varepsilon_{\mathrm{crypto}}. Union bound. \square

